## Module Roles

| Module | Role |
|------|------|
| `pms_generator.py` | Template to `Piping_Material_Class_Data` generation pipeline |
| `template_generator.py` | Input template and `Item_Code_DB` helper generation |
| `validator.py` | Template row validation (`data/component_mapping.json` rules) |
| `class_spec.py` | `Class_Define` to class technical envelope |
| `thickness_engine.py` | Thickness lookup from `Schedule` sheet |
| `project_constraints.py` | Merged project-level config validation (before generation) |
| `controller.py` | Orchestration between GUI and generation/validation engine |
| `gui.py`, `main.py` | UI and entrypoint only; no business logic |

## Boundary Rule

- Keep business logic in engine modules (`pms_generator.py`, `validator.py`, `class_spec.py`, `thickness_engine.py`, `project_constraints.py`).
- Do not implement domain/business rules in `gui.py` or `main.py`.
